%N A398462 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} AH(k) * AH(k,2) / k^2, where AH(k) = A058313(k)/A058312(k) is the k-th alternating harmonic (or skew-harmonic) number, and AH(k,2) = A119682(k)/A334580(k) is the k-th alternating harmonic (or skew-harmonic) number of order 2.
